  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "<p>Bowl raised from a single sheet of silver, parcel-gilt. On the inside a gilt scale medallion with a rosette in the center. The rows of the fish scale pattern are staggered. The medallion is framed first by a narrow silver strip and then by a gilt ''Achaemenid stepped battlement frieze''. Above the frieze there is a floral scroll framed by a gilt wave meander. Beneath the lip of the vessel there is a gilt ''Achaemenid stepped battlement frieze''. The ornamental friezes are set off by turned grooves. Undecorated exterior.</p>"
    ]
  },
